{"change_summary":"Completed the remaining provenance amendments by extending `param_meta` support, validation, range checks, and diagnostic-aware loaders to `PlantPreset` and `SubstratePreset`; making shrimp provenance resolution use `ShrimpRuntimeParams::default()` for omitted optional fields so formatter/range output matches runtime behavior; changing the generic formatter to preserve raw legacy process values when no metadata or unit is attached while still normalizing metadata-backed legacy fields; and tightening process validation to reject non-positive `shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days`. The current tree also keeps the preset-vs-runtime provenance boundary explicit: preset-layer `param_meta` carries provenance, while bare runtime `Default` values remain numeric-only.","outstanding_risks":["Callers that deserialize `PlantPreset`, `SubstratePreset`, `ShrimpPreset`, or `ProcessParamsPreset` directly with `toml::from_str` still need to invoke `validate()` and `check_ranges()` themselves or switch to the `load_*_with_diagnostics()` helpers to surface warning diagnostics.","Shipped plant, substrate, shrimp, and process preset TOMLs still do not contain real `[param_meta.*]` entries; this bead now supports the schema/load paths, but actual metadata enrichment remains downstream work.","The worktree contains unrelated pre-existing edits in multiple `tank_core`/`tank_tui` files plus untracked `.ralph-burning/` and `crates/tank_core/tests/plant_nutrient_normalization.rs`; they were left untouched.","The focused `tank_core` provenance target is currently blocked by an unrelated dirty-worktree compile error in `crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs`, so end-to-end validation for this pass is limited to the `tank_data` and `tank_scenarios` targets."],"steps":[{"description":"Inspected the five pending amendments against the current provenance/preset implementation and narrowed the write scope to the preset loader and formatter paths in `tank_data` plus the already-explicit preset-vs-runtime provenance boundary in the current tree.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Extended `PlantPreset` and `SubstratePreset` with per-parameter `param_meta` storage plus shared lookup, formatting, range-check, unknown-key rejection, and validation helpers, then routed the normal plant/substrate loaders through diagnostic-aware validation paths.","order":1,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Updated `ShrimpPreset` provenance lookup so omitted optional fields fall back to `ShrimpRuntimeParams::default()` values before formatting and range checks, and adjusted the shared formatter path so legacy process parameters stay raw when no metadata is attached.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Tightened `ProcessParamsPreset::validate()` to reject `shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days <= 0` and added regression coverage for plant/substrate metadata support, shrimp default-backed provenance rendering and warnings, and the raw-vs-normalized process formatting behavior.","order":3,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Ran the focused `tank_data` and `tank_scenarios` library tests, then attempted the focused `tank_core` provenance target to check for regressions outside the modified preset files.","order":4,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Resolve the unrelated dirty-worktree compile regression in `crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs` that blocks `cargo test -p tank_core --lib provenance`.","order":5,"status":"skipped"}],"validation_evidence":["`cargo test -p tank_data --lib` passed: 28 tests passed, 0 failed.","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios --lib` passed: 4 tests passed, 0 failed.","`tank_data` coverage now passes for the new plant/substrate `param_meta` roundtrip and unknown-key rejection cases, shrimp default-backed provenance formatting/range checks, raw legacy process formatting without metadata, and non-positive `shrimp_juvenile_maturation_days` rejection.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib provenance` is currently blocked before provenance tests run because `crates/tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs:291` cannot find `bicarbonate_mg_total_from_mmol_per_l`; that file is outside the scope of this provenance bead.","`git diff --stat -- crates/tank_data/src/lib.rs crates/tank_data/src/presets.rs` shows the scoped implementation delta is limited to those two preset/loader files."]}